    "There is a bright patch by the bus stop that has been bright for forty years.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بجوار موقف الحافلة بقعة مضيئة تتوهّج منذ أربعين سنة."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neben der Bushaltestelle gibt es einen hellen Fleck, der seit vierzig Jahren leuchtet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is a bright patch by the bus stop that has been bright for forty years."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hay una mancha brillante junto a la parada de autobús que lleva brillando cuarenta años."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il y a une tache lumineuse près de l’arrêt de bus qui brille depuis quarante ans."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C’è una macchia luminosa vicino alla fermata dell’autobus, luminosa da quarant’anni."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Há uma mancha brilhante perto do ponto de ônibus que brilha há quarenta anos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn't enough space on this device for the narration (%@). You can keep reading meanwhile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا توجد مساحة كافية على هذا الجهاز للسرد (%@). يمكنك متابعة القراءة في هذه الأثناء."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf diesem Gerät ist nicht genug Platz für die Erzählung (%@). Du kannst inzwischen weiterlesen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There isn't enough space on this device for the narration (%@). You can keep reading meanwhile."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No hay espacio suficiente en este dispositivo para la narración (%@). Puedes seguir leyendo mientras tanto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n’y a pas assez d’espace sur cet appareil pour la narration (%@). Tu peux continuer à lire en attendant."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non c’è abbastanza spazio su questo dispositivo per la narrazione (%@). Nel frattempo puoi continuare a leggere."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não há espaço suficiente neste aparelho para a narração (%@). Você pode continuar lendo enquanto isso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go over on one night in October, and everything nobody could say goes with them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يعبرن ليلةً واحدة في أكتوبر، ويذهب معهنّ كلّ ما لم يستطع أحد قوله."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie ziehen in einer Nacht im Oktober, und alles, was niemand sagen konnte, geht mit ihnen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They go over on one night in October, and everything nobody could say goes with them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasan una noche de octubre, y todo lo que nadie pudo decir se va con ellas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elles passent une nuit d’octobre, et tout ce que personne n’a su dire part avec elles."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passano una notte di ottobre, e tutto ciò che nessuno ha saputo dire va con loro."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elas passam numa noite de outubro, e tudo que ninguém conseguiu dizer vai com elas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears every chapter you have finished and every badge. Your favourites and your subscription stay.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمسح هذا كل فصل أكملته وكل شارة. تبقى قصصك المفضلة واشتراكك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Damit werden alle abgeschlossenen Kapitel und alle Abzeichen gelöscht. Deine Favoriten und dein Abo bleiben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This clears every chapter you have finished and every badge. Your favourites and your subscription stay."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto borra cada capítulo terminado y cada insignia. Tus favoritos y tu suscripción se conservan."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela efface tous les chapitres terminés et tous les badges. Tes favoris et ton abonnement restent."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancella ogni capitolo che hai finito e ogni distintivo. I tuoi preferiti e il tuo abbonamento restano."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isso limpa todos os capítulos que você concluiu e todos os selos. Seus favoritos e sua assinatura ficam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is only used to greet you. It stays on this device.": {
